	(text "logic max current = 500 mA\nmotors max current = 3 A\nATSAMD21G18 = 12 bit resolution\nwith shunt resistance = 40 mOhm\n50 v/v for motors = 19.6 mA resolution\n100 v/v for logic = 9.8 mA resolution"
